.MAIN.  MACRO RSTS/E V6.0                       29-MAY-75 15:57  PAGE 1
      1                                 ;
      2                                 ;
      3                                 ; PDP-11 ABSOLUTE BINARY LOADER -- VA07.00
      4                                 ;       DEC-11-UABLA-A-LA
      5                                 ;
      6                                 ;
      7                                 ;
      8                                 ;       DIGITAL EQUIPMENT CORPORATION, MAYNARD, MASS
      9                                 ;
