     16                                 ;       USE ON SUCH SYSTEM AND TO ONE WHO AGREES TO THESE LICENSE
     17                                 ;       TERMS. TITLE TO AND OWNERSHIP OF THE SOFTWARE SHALL AT ALL
     18                                 ;       TIMES REMAIN IN DIGITAL EQUIPMENT CORPORATION.
     19                                 ;
     20                                 ;       THE INFORMATION IN THIS DOCUMENT IS SUBJECT TO CHANGE
     21                                 ;       WITHOUT NOTICE AND SHOULD NOT BE CONSTRUED AS A COMMITMENT
     22                                 ;       BY DIGITAL EQUIPMENT CORPORATION.
     23                                 ;
